{%- comment -%}
  AJ About — the origin story.

  EVERY WORD IS A SETTING, NOT MARKUP. This is the page most likely to be
  reworded on a whim, and copy baked into a section means a git push and a
  theme deploy to change a comma. All of it is editable in the theme editor;
  the defaults below are Alex's text, verbatim.

  THE FOUNDERS STAY ANONYMOUS. "Two coworkers", never names, never photos --
  that is the brand's choice and the layout must not quietly undermine it by
  leaving a headshot slot that begs to be filled.

  MEASURE IS CAPPED AT 62ch. This is the only long-form reading on the site and
  the rest of the theme is built for product grids, so the page-width container
  would run these lines past 120 characters on a desktop -- unreadable in a way
  that reads as "nobody looked at this".

  THE TAGLINE BAND IS INK ON YELLOW, never yellow type. aj-brand.css measured
  it: yellow on white is 1.32:1, which fails WCAG 1.4.3 at any size. Ink on that
  yellow is 11.17:1. The accent is a background here or it is not used.

  IT ENDS ON THE PRODUCT. An About page that finishes with feelings and no exit
  spends attention it just earned -- so the last thing on the page is today's
  Yoink and the Bin, which is what somebody who just read all this is primed to
  go and look at.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
-%}

<div
  class="aj-about color-{{ s.color_scheme }}"
  style="padding-block-start: {{ s.padding-block-start }}px; padding-block-end: {{ s.padding-block-end }}px;"
  {{ section.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="aj-about__inner">
    {%- if s.eyebrow != blank -%}
      <p class="aj-about__eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.heading != blank -%}
      <h1 class="aj-about__heading">{{ s.heading | escape }}</h1>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.lead != blank -%}
      <p class="aj-about__lead">{{ s.lead }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.body_1 != blank -%}
      <div class="aj-about__body rte">{{ s.body_1 }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.pull_quote != blank -%}
      <p class="aj-about__pull">{{ s.pull_quote | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.body_2 != blank -%}
      <div class="aj-about__body rte">{{ s.body_2 }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.signoff != blank -%}
      <p class="aj-about__signoff">{{ s.signoff | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.tagline != blank -%}
      <p class="aj-about__tagline">{{ s.tagline | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.primary_text != blank or s.secondary_text != blank -%}
      <div class="aj-about__actions">
        {%- if s.primary_text != blank -%}
          <a class="aj-about__btn aj-about__btn--primary" href="{{ s.primary_link | default: '/' }}">
            {{- s.primary_text | escape -}}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if s.secondary_text != blank -%}
          <a class="aj-about__btn aj-about__btn--ghost" href="{{ s.secondary_link | default: '/' }}">
            {{- s.secondary_text | escape -}}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .aj-about {
    padding-inline: 1.25rem;
  }

  /* 62ch, not page-width. See the note at the top of this file. */
  .aj-about__inner {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .aj-about__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--aj-price-act, #7a3fa0);
  }

  .aj-about__heading {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.05;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  /* The opening paragraph carries the hook, so it is set larger than the body
     and lighter than the heading -- a bridge between the two rather than a
     third competing size. */
  .aj-about__lead {
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .aj-about__body > * + * {
    margin-block-start: 1.25rem;
  }

  .aj-about__body p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* Set as a bordered aside rather than centred italics: this is a punchline in
     the middle of a story, and centring it would break the reading column that
     the rest of the page depends on. */
  .aj-about__pull {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: 0.25rem 0 0.25rem 1.25rem;
    border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--aj-price-act, #7a3fa0);
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .aj-about__signoff {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Ink on yellow. Never yellow type -- 1.32:1 against white. */
  .aj-about__tagline {
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: var(--aj-tile-radius, 8px);
    background: var(--aj-price-grab, #ffe000);
    color: var(--aj-price-read, #282828);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .aj-about__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-block-start: 1.5rem;
  }

  .aj-about__btn {
    flex: 1 1 12rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--aj-tile-radius, 8px);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
  }

  .aj-about__btn--primary {
    background: var(--aj-price-act, #7a3fa0);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .aj-about__btn--ghost {
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.25);
    color: inherit;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .aj-about__btn:hover {
      opacity: 0.88;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .aj-about__lead {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
    }

    .aj-about__pull {
      font-size: 1.1875rem;
    }

    /* Stacked rather than side by side: two half-width buttons on a phone are
       two small buttons. */
    .aj-about__btn {
      flex-basis: 100%;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AJ About",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The origin story. Founders stay anonymous — 'two coworkers', no names, no photos."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "About us" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Two coworkers who refused to stop hanging out"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "lead",
      "label": "Opening paragraph",
      "default": "<p>So, funny thing about a good coworker: you don't realize they're the whole point of the job until one of them packs up and moves away. That's us. Two guys who used to sit near each other, scheme near each other, and get in trouble near each other — until one of us left and the office got real quiet.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body_1",
      "label": "Body — before the pull quote",
      "default": "<p>Naturally, we handled it in the most normal way possible. We started an online store.</p><p>The Yoink is our excuse to keep hanging out, keep scheming, and finally have some fun with retail — because the places we came from were about as playful as a tax form. Case in point: one of us stayed up half the night last week, wide awake, brain fully hijacked by what should tomorrow's deal be. That's not a healthy relationship with a website. We're aware. We're not stopping.</p><p>Here's the bit: every single day, we go dig up one genuinely cool, slightly random, actually-worth-owning thing — and drop it at a price that feels a little bit illegal.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pull_quote",
      "label": "Pull quote",
      "default": "One deal. One day. Blink and it's someone else's."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body_2",
      "label": "Body — after the pull quote",
      "default": "<p>We call it the Yoink of the Day, because yoink is the sound of grabbing something great half a second before the person next to you.</p><p>Nature's already full of professionals at this. Raccoons yoink the dog food. Seagulls yoink the fries. Bears yoink the whole picnic basket and don't even say thank you. We're just doing it with better taste and free-ish shipping — a little retail Robin Hood move where somehow everybody wins: you get the score, the good stuff finds its people, and we get to keep the lights on.</p><p>To be clear, we are not out here trying to buy a yacht. A canoe, maybe. Mostly we just like tracking down cool stuff for cheap and handing you the deal like it's a dare. Some days the Yoink is exactly what you didn't know you needed. Some days it's a penguin-shaped thing that is very much Not For You — no notes, there's a new one tomorrow.</p><p>So stick around. Watch the drops. Rummage the Bargain Bin between yoinks. And when the good one hits — you know what to do.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "signoff",
      "label": "Sign-off",
      "default": "Welcome to The Yoink. Yoink accordingly. ⚡"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tagline",
      "label": "Tagline band",
      "default": "One deal a day. Yoink it before it's gone."
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Buttons" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "primary_text", "label": "Primary button", "default": "See today's Yoink" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "primary_link", "label": "Primary link" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "secondary_text", "label": "Secondary button", "default": "Dig through the Bargain Bin" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "secondary_link", "label": "Secondary link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Appearance" },
    { "type": "color_scheme", "id": "color_scheme", "label": "Color scheme", "default": "scheme-1" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Padding" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding-block-start", "label": "Top", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 60 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding-block-end", "label": "Bottom", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 60 }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "AJ About" }]
}
{% endschema %}
